  "display_title": "Eurydice's Coffin",
  "description": "Poor Eurydice is cursed to go back a year in time if she dies before turning 20. Although she has died 14 times and woken up again as a 19-year-old woman, all her loved ones have aged normally. That includes her now 34-year-old husband, Orpheus, who thinks he's the only one with memories of Eurydice's past lives. However, Eurydice also remembers every futile attempt to survive. Despite their love for each other, the tragic couple can feel their hearts growing numb with each forboding death. Will Eurydice finally make it to her 20th birthday and break this cycle of pain?\n\n(Source: Tappytoon)",
